///  * The [catalog of layout widgets](https://flutter.dev/widgets/layout/).␀ÀÊ|w␀ÀÊ¸ÀÊÀ3/// Creates a widget that visually hides its child.ÀÊÃ	ÀÊÊ␀␀ÀÊÎÀÊÔ␀␀ÀÊäÀÊë␀␀ÀÊŞÀÊ÷‚ÀÍn‚Q/// Whether the child is hidden from the rest of the tree.
///
/// If true, the child is laid out as if it was in the tree, but without
/// painting anything, without making the child available for hit testing, and
/// without taking any room in the parent.
