/// flexes.À$	À+␀␀À3À9␀␀ÀFÀL␀␀ÀdÀt␀␀À?ÀQÀXÀYÀƒoÀîT/// The flex factor to use for this child.
///
/// If null or zero, the child is inflexible and determines its own size. If
