///   * [RenderObject.dispose], which instructs a render object to release
///     any resources it may be holding.␀␀À³µLÀ³Ë␀␀À³ŞÀ³ì␀␀À³µÀ³¶À´lÀ´␀␀À´)À´7␀␀À´?À´J␀␀À´À´À´u€†À´†␀␀À´À´«␀␀À´uÀ´v␀Àµ“¦À¹ƒô/// A widget that calls callbacks in response to common pointer events.
